.DS_Store
# Windows reserved-name file: created when a command meant to discard output to
# the NUL device (`-o nul` / `> nul`) runs under a POSIX shell (Git Bash/MSYS/WSL),
# where `nul` is an ordinary filename. Use /dev/null in POSIX-executed commands.
nul

